Hi {Owner},

I build websites for hearing and audiology clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has warm reviews, but no site where a first-time patient, or the son or daughter booking for them, can see what a hearing test involves and book one without phoning.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: the hearing test explained step by step, hearing aid styles with placeholders for your price bands, a page for families, tinnitus consultations, aftercare and repairs, and online booking that keeps health details off the form. It uses marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes after clinic hours?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

